  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Option 1,2 and 3 have chiral carbon in which inversion of configuration takes place during&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mrow></mrow></msubsup><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;reaction but 4<sup>th</sup> option has achiral carbon associated with halogen&nbsp; group so it will show retention after substitution reaction.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\ot4_0092_0ffeeb4dd801.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 79px;\" /></p>"
